{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16190661331808844818,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Installation",
      "source_hash": 3946118778645798643,
      "context_hash": 1675144438186450931,
      "translation": "설치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`std::offload` is partly available in nightly builds for users.",
      "source_hash": 5508548863403710698,
      "context_hash": 3701397384768535254,
      "translation": "`std::offload`는 나이틀리 빌드에서 부분적으로 사용자에게 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For now, everyone however still needs to build rustc from source to use all features of it.",
      "source_hash": 1343185273943198653,
      "context_hash": 10799723436077852200,
      "translation": "그러나 현재로서는 모든 기능을 사용하려면 여전히 누구나 rustc를 소스에서 직접 빌드해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rustup installation.",
      "source_hash": 11581383642605258322,
      "context_hash": 8524370149465968144,
      "translation": "Rustup 설치.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If you are on `x86_64` Linux, you can install the nightly toolchain with:",
      "source_hash": 2991101427065973086,
      "context_hash": 17217221549392453455,
      "translation": "`x86_64` Linux를 사용 중이라면, 다음 명령으로 나이틀리 툴체인을 설치할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Build instructions",
      "source_hash": 7719437218166934737,
      "context_hash": 13089655336627998225,
      "translation": "빌드 지침",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Otherwise you need to clone and configure the Rust repository:",
      "source_hash": 1329571475055142958,
      "context_hash": 17480793702546856354,
      "translation": "그렇지 않다면 Rust 저장소를 클론하고 구성해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Afterwards you can build rustc using:",
      "source_hash": 9216126828604934303,
      "context_hash": 11839262452005654808,
      "translation": "그런 다음 다음 명령으로 rustc를 빌드할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Afterwards rustc toolchain link will allow you to use it through cargo:",
      "source_hash": 6512617709234165590,
      "context_hash": 10079871950476858363,
      "translation": "그 후 rustc toolchain link를 통해 cargo에서 이를 사용할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Build instruction for LLVM itself",
      "source_hash": 10427670116006484008,
      "context_hash": 4334869040928128070,
      "translation": "LLVM 자체에 대한 빌드 지침",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This gives you a working LLVM build.",
      "source_hash": 4462979549493317618,
      "context_hash": 15932103707001783728,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 작동하는 LLVM 빌드를 얻게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Testing",
      "source_hash": 3506138006682880407,
      "context_hash": 10386940751093942798,
      "translation": "테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Run this test script for offload-specific tests:",
      "source_hash": 13732645107278334249,
      "context_hash": 14835036899188636754,
      "translation": "offload 관련 테스트를 실행하려면 이 테스트 스크립트를 실행하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For testing the CI locally, you may use the commands outlined in [Testing with Docker](../tests/docker.md):",
      "source_hash": 9209174418635272994,
      "context_hash": 6852585908816738845,
      "translation": "CI를 로컬에서 테스트하려면 [Testing with Docker](../tests/docker.md)에 설명된 명령을 사용할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604182Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "This stores all compiler artifacts in the `obj` directory, however should you modify rustc-specific code, you may need to delete this directory as the Docker image will cache its state otherwise.",
      "source_hash": 8278264100595288595,
      "context_hash": 2244808624858554993,
      "translation": "이는 모든 컴파일러 산출물을 `obj` 디렉터리에 저장하지만, rustc 관련 코드를 수정한 경우 이 디렉터리를 삭제해야 할 수도 있습니다. 그렇지 않으면 Docker 이미지가 해당 상태를 캐시하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604182Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Submodules should also be checked out at this point.",
      "source_hash": 8499299261430466988,
      "context_hash": 237675500125002927,
      "translation": "이 시점에서 서브모듈도 체크아웃되어 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:16.604182Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}